    <title>唐诗三百首草书字帖</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "KaiTi", serif; background-color: #f9f6f1; color: #333; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .poem-box { background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 5px; }
